{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>I will make My arrows drunk with blood.</b> The blood of the enemy." "<b>And My sword shall devour.</b> Their flesh." "<b>Of the blood of the slain and the captives.</b> This shall be their retribution for the sin of the blood of Israel's slain and the captives they took from them." "<b>From the head of the enemy's breaches.</b> For the sin at the beginning of the enemy's breaches — for when the Holy One, blessed be He, exacts vengeance from the nations, He calls them to account for their sin and for their fathers' sins from the start of the breach they made against Israel."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:29.816347701Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}